What about when the leaf key is matched but with an inline scalar value (e.g. `contextWindow: 2000`)? _blockEnd(lines, keyLine, depth) — the value is inline so block body is empty → removes just that line. Then checks the parent (modelId at depth 2). If empty → removed. Then provider (depth 1), etc. Good.

Potential edge: `_findKeyLine` breaks the scan when `_indentOf(lines[i]) < depth * 2 && i > cursor`. OK.

